1
00:00:00,997 --> 00:00:03,497
- What's your favorite fruit?
- It, uh...

2
00:00:04,167 --> 00:00:05,207
(Steph:)Strawberries.

3
00:00:05,377 --> 00:00:07,457
(Sheldon:)Mm, technically not a fruit, but all right.

4
00:00:09,589 --> 00:00:11,679
(Sheldon:)Where did you do
your medical internship?

5
00:00:11,841 --> 00:00:14,011
(Steph:)Uh, Lawrence Memorial
in Galveston, Texas.

6
00:00:14,177 --> 00:00:16,177
(Sheldon:)Really? That's where I was born.

7
00:00:18,848 --> 00:00:20,178
- You're kidding.
SHELDON: No.

8
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:23,140
(Sheldon:)I spent so much of my childhood
at that hospital. It...

9
00:00:23,311 --> 00:00:26,351
(Sheldon:)When I was 12,
I got to ride there in a helicopter.

10
00:00:27,023 --> 00:00:30,233
- What? What happened?
- Radiation burns.

11
00:00:30,402 --> 00:00:33,362
(Sheldon:)A little mishap
while I was building my own CAT scanner.

12
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:36,780
(Steph:)I'm sorry, you tried to build
your own CAT scanner?

13
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,910
(Sheldon:)No, I didn't try, I succeeded.

14
00:00:39,077 --> 00:00:42,707
(Sheldon:)I was briefly able to see the inside
of my sister's guinea pig, Snowball...

15
00:00:42,872 --> 00:00:44,872
(Sheldon:)...before he caught fire.

16
00:00:45,583 --> 00:00:47,873
(Sheldon:)It led to an interesting expression
in our house:

17
00:00:48,044 --> 00:00:50,794
(Sheldon:)Not a Snowball's chance
in a CAT scanner.

18
00:00:52,382 --> 00:00:54,632
(Leonard:)Uh, Sheldon.

19
00:00:55,302 --> 00:00:56,382
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

20
00:00:57,304 --> 00:01:00,724
(Sheldon:)When I come back, just for fun,
the subject will be alternative history.

